// The site as a Workers Static Assets project (INCIDENTS #1004). Cloudflare Pages refuses more than 20,000 files in a
// deployment; a Worker with static assets takes up to 100,000 on a paid plan (the account has Workers Paid).
// NOT read by Cloudflare Pages (the file name is not wrangler.jsonc): the Pages project keeps serving the site until
// the owner points the domain at this Worker. Test: `npx wrangler dev --config wrangler.static.jsonc` after a build.
//
// «النشر السريع» (INCIDENTS #1296): site-worker/ runs only for an address with no file and for the three listings
// (run_worker_first); every real file is served straight from the assets as before. It shows a page the panel saved a
// moment ago from arw-site-bot (FAST) until this deployment has it, never after (site-worker/fast.js).
{
  "name": "arw-site-static",
  "main": "site-worker/index.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./_site",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "none",
    "run_worker_first": ["/", "/shows/", "/news/"]
  },
  "services": [{ "binding": "FAST", "service": "arw-site-bot" }]
}
